{"id":"1t-1-4","courseId":"1t","chapterNumber":"1.4","title":"Cuovkarehkenastin","description":"Oahpa geardut, juohkit, oanidit ja viiddidit (no: utvide) cuovkkaid, ja maiddái lasihit cuovkkaid main lea seamma ja sierralágan namuheaddji.","estimatedMinutes":60,"competenceGoals":["guorahallat ja válddahallat cuovkkaid ja cuovkaoperašuvnnaid iešvuođaid"],"content":[{"id":"1t-1-4-intro","type":"text","content":"Dán kapihttalis oahpat rehkenastit cuovkkaiguin. Mii álgit geahččat movt mii geardut cuovkkaid oktii."},{"id":"1t-1-4-theorem-mult","type":"theorem","title":"Cuovkkaid geardun","content":"$$\\frac{a}{b} \\cdot \\frac{c}{d} = \\frac{a \\cdot c}{b \\cdot d} = \\frac{ac}{bd}$$\n\nGo mii galgat geardut guokte cuovkka oktii, de geardut dan mii lea cuovkasárgá badjelis dainna mii lea cuovkasárgá badjelis, ja dan mii lea cuovkasárgá vuolde dainna mii lea cuovkasárgá vuolde."},{"id":"1t-1-4-text-heltall","type":"text","content":"**Olleslogu geardun cuvkkiin:**\n\n$$a \\cdot \\frac{b}{c} = \\frac{a}{1} \\cdot \\frac{b}{c} = \\frac{a \\cdot b}{1 \\cdot c} = \\frac{ab}{c}$$"},{"id":"1t-1-4-example-1","type":"example","title":"Ovdamearka 1","problem":"Geardde cuovkkaid oktii:\n\na) $\\frac{1}{5} \\cdot \\frac{3}{2}$\n\nb) $3 \\cdot \\frac{3}{2}$","solution":"**Čoavddus:**\n\na) $\\frac{1}{5} \\cdot \\frac{3}{2} = \\frac{1 \\cdot 3}{5 \\cdot 2} = \\frac{3}{10}$\n\nb) $3 \\cdot \\frac{3}{2} = \\frac{3}{1} \\cdot \\frac{3}{2} = \\frac{3 \\cdot 3}{1 \\cdot 2} = \\frac{9}{2}$","solutionVideo":"qsSbmOSSmo8"},{"id":"1t-1-4-ex-block-1","type":"exercise","exercise":{"id":"1t-1-4-ex-1","number":"1","type":"classic","difficulty":"lett","task":"Geardde cuovkkaid oktii","subTasks":[{"label":"a","task":"$\\frac{3}{4} \\cdot \\frac{1}{7}$","solution":"$\\frac{3}{4} \\cdot \\frac{1}{7} = \\frac{3}{28}$","expressionAnswer":"3/28"},{"label":"b","task":"$\\frac{9}{2} \\cdot \\frac{3}{7}$","solution":"$\\frac{9}{2} \\cdot \\frac{3}{7} = \\frac{27}{14}$","expressionAnswer":"27/14"},{"label":"c","task":"$7 \\cdot \\frac{2}{5}$","solution":"$7 \\cdot \\frac{2}{5} = \\frac{14}{5}$","expressionAnswer":"14/5"},{"label":"d","task":"$\\frac{1}{3} \\cdot \\frac{2}{3} \\cdot \\frac{4}{3}$","solution":"$\\frac{1}{3} \\cdot \\frac{2}{3} \\cdot \\frac{4}{3} = \\frac{8}{27}$","expressionAnswer":"8/27"},{"label":"e","task":"$\\frac{5}{4} \\cdot 3$","solution":"$\\frac{5}{4} \\cdot 3 = \\frac{15}{4}$","expressionAnswer":"15/4"},{"label":"f","task":"$2 \\cdot \\frac{3}{7} \\cdot \\frac{1}{5}$","solution":"$2 \\cdot \\frac{3}{7} \\cdot \\frac{1}{5} = \\frac{6}{35}$","expressionAnswer":"6/35"}],"hints":["Muitte: Geardde čájeheaddji čájeheaddjiin ja namuheaddji namuheaddjiin"],"solution":"a) $\\frac{3}{28}$, b) $\\frac{27}{14}$, c) $\\frac{14}{5}$, d) $\\frac{8}{27}$, e) $\\frac{15}{4}$, f) $\\frac{6}{35}$","solutionVideo":"bbQhT1UnfD4","allowsUpload":true,"allowsCanvasDrawing":true}},{"id":"1t-1-4-text-forkorte","type":"text","content":"**Cuovkkaid oanideapmi**\n\nGo mii galgat oanidit cuovkkaid, de sáhttá leat ávkkálaš muitit ahte mii sáhttit buvttadit (no: faktorisere) loguid. Ovdamearkka dihte: $8 = 4 \\cdot 2$ ja $12 = 4 \\cdot 3 = 2 \\cdot 2 \\cdot 3$ dahje $12 = 2 \\cdot 6$"},{"id":"1t-1-4-example-2","type":"example","title":"Ovdamearka 2","problem":"Oanit cuovkkaid:\n\na) $\\frac{8}{6}$\n\nb) $\\frac{45}{75}$","solution":"**Čoavddus:**\n\na) $\\frac{8}{6} = \\frac{4 \\cdot {\\color{red}2}}{3 \\cdot {\\color{red}2}} = \\frac{4}{3}$\n\nb) $\\frac{45}{75} = \\frac{{\\color{red}3} \\cdot 15}{{\\color{red}3} \\cdot 25} = \\frac{3 \\cdot {\\color{red}5}}{{\\color{red}5} \\cdot 5} = \\frac{3}{5}$\n\n**Fuom.:** Jos mii oaidnit dan, de sáhttit dahkat dan vel álkibut:\n$\\frac{45}{75} = \\frac{3 \\cdot {\\color{red}15}}{5 \\cdot {\\color{red}15}} = \\frac{3}{5}$\n\n*Goappašat vuogit leat riekta. Álggus sáhtát bidjat fokusa oanidit dan maid nagodat. Maŋŋil sáhtát eanet jurddašit movt sáhtát oanidit nu stuora loguin go vejolaš.*","solutionVideo":"w2Iskug2cuQ"},{"id":"1t-1-4-ex-block-2","type":"exercise","exercise":{"id":"1t-1-4-ex-2","number":"2","type":"classic","difficulty":"lett","task":"Oanit cuovkkaid nu olu go vejolaš. Muitte ahte $\\frac{a}{1} = a$","subTasks":[{"label":"a","task":"$\\frac{10}{4}$","solution":"$\\frac{10}{4} = \\frac{5}{2}$","expressionAnswer":"5/2"},{"label":"b","task":"$\\frac{25}{10}$","solution":"$\\frac{25}{10} = \\frac{5}{2}$","expressionAnswer":"5/2"},{"label":"c","task":"$\\frac{10}{5}$","solution":"$\\frac{10}{5} = 2$","answer":2},{"label":"d","task":"$\\frac{81}{27}$","solution":"$\\frac{81}{27} = 3$","answer":3},{"label":"e","task":"$\\frac{2 \\cdot 4}{3 \\cdot 4}$","solution":"$\\frac{2 \\cdot 4}{3 \\cdot 4} = \\frac{2}{3}$","expressionAnswer":"2/3"},{"label":"f","task":"$\\frac{12 \\cdot 20}{4 \\cdot 6}$","solution":"$\\frac{12 \\cdot 20}{4 \\cdot 6} = 10$","answer":10}],"hints":["Gávnna oktasaš fáktoriid čájeheaddjis ja namuheaddjis"],"solution":"a) $\\frac{5}{2}$, b) $\\frac{5}{2}$, c) $2$, d) $3$, e) $\\frac{2}{3}$, f) $10$","solutionVideo":"0izwvXP6QpA","allowsUpload":true,"allowsCanvasDrawing":true}},{"id":"1t-1-4-text-mult-forkort","type":"text","content":"**Cuovkkaid geardun ja oanideapmi**\n\nGo mii geardut cuovkkaid, de sáhttit dávjá oanidit dađistaga vai rehkenastin šaddá álkit."},{"id":"1t-1-4-example-3","type":"example","title":"Ovdamearka 3","problem":"Rehkenaste ja oanit jos vejolaš:\n\na) $\\frac{10}{5} \\cdot \\frac{3}{2}$\n\nb) $\\frac{6}{5} \\cdot \\frac{15}{2}$\n\nc) $4 \\cdot \\frac{3}{4}$","solution":"**Čoavddus:**\n\na) $\\frac{10}{5} \\cdot \\frac{3}{2} = \\frac{{\\color{red}10} \\cdot 3}{{\\color{red}10}} = 3$\n\n**Fuom.:** Fuomáš ahte mii geardduimet dan mii lea cuovkka vuolde dakkaviđe oktii, muhto eat dan mii lea cuovkka badjelis. Dat lea danin go mii háliidit nu jođánit go vejolaš sáhttit sihkkut 10 cuovkasárgá badjelis ja vuolde.\n\nb) $\\frac{6}{5} \\cdot \\frac{15}{2} = \\frac{6 \\cdot 15}{5 \\cdot 2} = \\frac{{\\color{red}2} \\cdot 3 \\cdot 3 \\cdot {\\color{blue}5}}{{\\color{blue}5} \\cdot {\\color{red}2}} = 9$\n\nc) $4 \\cdot \\frac{3}{4} = 3$ danin go $4 \\cdot \\frac{3}{4} = \\frac{4}{1} \\cdot \\frac{3}{4} = \\frac{{\\color{red}4} \\cdot 3}{1 \\cdot {\\color{red}4}} = 3$","solutionVideo":"2jEju9aEXPs"},{"id":"1t-1-4-ex-block-3","type":"exercise","exercise":{"id":"1t-1-4-ex-3","number":"3","type":"classic","difficulty":"medium","task":"Rehkenaste ja oanit jos vejolaš","subTasks":[{"label":"a","task":"$\\frac{2}{5} \\cdot \\frac{3}{2}$","solution":"$\\frac{2}{5} \\cdot \\frac{3}{2} = \\frac{3}{5}$","expressionAnswer":"3/5"},{"label":"b","task":"$\\frac{12}{3} \\cdot \\frac{3}{4}$","solution":"$\\frac{12}{3} \\cdot \\frac{3}{4} = 3$","answer":3},{"label":"c","task":"$5 \\cdot \\frac{3}{4}$","solution":"$5 \\cdot \\frac{3}{4} = \\frac{15}{4}$","expressionAnswer":"15/4"},{"label":"d","task":"$\\frac{12}{5} \\cdot \\frac{15}{6}$","solution":"$\\frac{12}{5} \\cdot \\frac{15}{6} = 6$","answer":6},{"label":"e","task":"$\\frac{8}{30} \\cdot \\frac{15}{4}$","solution":"$\\frac{8}{30} \\cdot \\frac{15}{4} = 1$","answer":1},{"label":"f","task":"$\\frac{7}{26} \\cdot \\frac{13}{14} \\cdot 6$","solution":"$\\frac{7}{26} \\cdot \\frac{13}{14} \\cdot 6 = \\frac{3}{2}$","expressionAnswer":"3/2"}],"hints":["Geahččal oanidit ovdal go geardut vai oaččut álkit loguid"],"solution":"a) $\\frac{3}{5}$, b) $3$, c) $\\frac{15}{4}$, d) $6$, e) $1$, f) $\\frac{3}{2}$","solutionVideo":"BnX4wmsLCYc","allowsUpload":true,"allowsCanvasDrawing":true}},{"id":"1t-1-4-theorem-div","type":"theorem","title":"Cuovkkaid juohkin","content":"Go mii juohkit cuovkka eará cuovkkain, de sáhttit:\n\n$$\\frac{a}{b} \\div \\frac{c}{d} = \\frac{a}{b} \\cdot \\frac{d}{c} = \\frac{a \\cdot d}{b \\cdot c}$$\n\nSierralágan dáhpáhus dás lea go mii juohkit olleslogu vuostá:\n\n$$\\frac{a}{b} \\div c = \\frac{a}{b} \\div \\frac{c}{1} = \\frac{a}{b} \\cdot \\frac{1}{c} = \\frac{a}{b \\cdot c}$$"},{"id":"1t-1-4-example-4","type":"example","title":"Ovdamearka 4","problem":"Rehkenaste:\n\na) $\\frac{2}{7} \\div \\frac{3}{2}$\n\nb) $7 \\div \\frac{15}{2}$\n\nc) $\\frac{3}{4} \\div 9$","solution":"**Čoavddus:**\n\na) $\\frac{2}{7} \\div \\frac{3}{2} = \\frac{2}{7} \\cdot \\frac{2}{3} = \\frac{4}{21}$\n\nb) $7 \\div \\frac{15}{2} = \\frac{7}{1} \\cdot \\frac{2}{15} = \\frac{14}{15}$\n\nc) $\\frac{3}{4} \\div 9 = \\frac{3}{4} \\div \\frac{9}{1} = \\frac{3}{4} \\cdot \\frac{1}{9} = \\frac{3 \\cdot 1}{4 \\cdot 9} = \\frac{{\\color{red}3} \\cdot 1}{4 \\cdot {\\color{red}3} \\cdot 3} = \\frac{1}{12}$","solutionVideo":"8qJoxtSMFFQ"},{"id":"1t-1-4-ex-block-4","type":"exercise","exercise":{"id":"1t-1-4-ex-4","number":"4","type":"classic","difficulty":"medium","task":"Čađat juohkima ja oanit cuovkka jos vejolaš","subTasks":[{"label":"a","task":"$\\frac{7}{5} \\div \\frac{3}{2}$","solution":"$\\frac{7}{5} \\div \\frac{3}{2} = \\frac{14}{15}$","expressionAnswer":"14/15"},{"label":"b","task":"$\\frac{3}{8} \\div \\frac{5}{2}$","solution":"$\\frac{3}{8} \\div \\frac{5}{2} = \\frac{3}{20}$","expressionAnswer":"3/20"},{"label":"c","task":"$\\frac{10}{2} \\div \\frac{5}{2}$","solution":"$\\frac{10}{2} \\div \\frac{5}{2} = 2$","answer":2},{"label":"d","task":"$8 \\div \\frac{3}{2}$","solution":"$8 \\div \\frac{3}{2} = \\frac{16}{3}$","expressionAnswer":"16/3"},{"label":"e","task":"$\\frac{5}{6} \\div 3$","solution":"$\\frac{5}{6} \\div 3 = \\frac{5}{18}$","expressionAnswer":"5/18"},{"label":"f","task":"$3 \\cdot \\frac{1}{5} \\div \\frac{7}{2}$","solution":"$3 \\cdot \\frac{1}{5} \\div \\frac{7}{2} = \\frac{6}{35}$","expressionAnswer":"6/35"}],"hints":["Muitte: Cuovkkain juohkin lea seamma go geardut jorggu cuovkkain"],"solution":"a) $\\frac{14}{15}$, b) $\\frac{3}{20}$, c) $2$, d) $\\frac{16}{3}$, e) $\\frac{5}{18}$, f) $\\frac{6}{35}$","solutionVideo":"k_eBSOdeOQc","allowsUpload":true,"allowsCanvasDrawing":true}},{"id":"1t-1-4-theorem-brudden","type":"theorem","title":"Cuvkejuvvon cuovka","content":"$$\\frac{\\frac{a}{b}}{\\frac{c}{d}} = \\frac{a}{b} \\div \\frac{c}{d} = \\frac{a}{b} \\cdot \\frac{d}{c} = \\frac{a \\cdot d}{b \\cdot c} = \\frac{ad}{bc}$$"},{"id":"1t-1-4-example-5","type":"example","title":"Ovdamearka 5","problem":"Čoavdde cuvkejuvvon cuovkka:\n\n$$\\frac{\\frac{2}{3}}{\\frac{5}{6}}$$","solution":"**Čoavddus:**\n\n**Molssaeaktu 1:**\n$$\\frac{\\frac{2}{3}}{\\frac{5}{6}} = \\frac{2}{3} \\div \\frac{5}{6} = \\frac{2}{3} \\cdot \\frac{6}{5} = \\frac{2 \\cdot 2 \\cdot {\\color{red}3}}{{\\color{red}3} \\cdot 5} = \\frac{4}{5}$$\n\n**Molssaeaktu 2:**\n$$\\frac{\\frac{2}{3}}{\\frac{5}{6}} = \\frac{\\frac{2}{3} \\cdot {\\color{blue}6}}{\\frac{5}{{\\color{blue}6}} \\cdot {\\color{blue}6}} = \\frac{\\frac{2 \\cdot 6}{3}}{\\frac{5 \\cdot {\\color{red}6}}{{\\color{red}6}}} = \\frac{\\frac{2 \\cdot 2 \\cdot {\\color{red}3}}{{\\color{red}3}}}{5} = \\frac{4}{5}$$","solutionVideo":"uxetXc8Tk1Q"},{"id":"1t-1-4-ex-block-5","type":"exercise","exercise":{"id":"1t-1-4-ex-5","number":"5","type":"classic","difficulty":"medium","task":"Čađat juohkima ja oanit cuovkka jos vejolaš. Fuom.: Alimus oahppanboađu várás ávžžuhuvvo čoavdit nugo molssaeaktu 2 ovdamearkkas.","subTasks":[{"label":"a","task":"$\\frac{\\frac{1}{3}}{\\frac{2}{3}}$","solution":"$\\frac{\\frac{1}{3}}{\\frac{2}{3}} = \\frac{1}{2}$","expressionAnswer":"1/2"},{"label":"b","task":"$\\frac{\\frac{1}{4}}{\\frac{2}{12}}$","solution":"$\\frac{\\frac{1}{4}}{\\frac{2}{12}} = \\frac{3}{2}$","expressionAnswer":"3/2"},{"label":"c","task":"$\\frac{5}{\\frac{2}{3}}$","solution":"$\\frac{5}{\\frac{2}{3}} = \\frac{15}{2}$","expressionAnswer":"15/2"}],"hints":["Cuvkejuvvon cuovkka sáhttá čállit juohkin"],"solution":"a) $\\frac{1}{2}$, b) $\\frac{3}{2}$, c) $\\frac{15}{2}$","solutionVideo":"Y6ny8zmkD54","allowsUpload":true,"allowsCanvasDrawing":true}},{"id":"1t-1-4-theorem-addlik","type":"theorem","title":"Cuovkkaid lasiheapmi seamma namuheaddjiin","content":"$$\\frac{a}{c} + \\frac{b}{c} = \\frac{a + b}{c}$$"},{"id":"1t-1-4-example-6","type":"example","title":"Ovdamearka 6","problem":"Geasa cuovkkaid oktii:\n\n$$\\frac{1}{5} + \\frac{2}{5}$$","solution":"**Čoavddus:**\n\n$$\\frac{1}{5} + \\frac{2}{5} = \\frac{1 + 2}{5} = \\frac{3}{5}$$","solutionVideo":"-ax2cbE3kkw"},{"id":"1t-1-4-example-7","type":"example","title":"Ovdamearka 7","problem":"Geasa cuovkkaid oktii ja oanit jos vejolaš:\n\n$$\\frac{9}{4} - \\frac{1}{4}$$","solution":"**Čoavddus:**\n\n$$\\frac{9}{4} - \\frac{1}{4} = \\frac{9 - 1}{4} = \\frac{8}{4} = 2$$","solutionVideo":"8eA_dk2bg5o"},{"id":"1t-1-4-ex-block-6","type":"exercise","exercise":{"id":"1t-1-4-ex-6","number":"6","type":"classic","difficulty":"lett","task":"Geasa cuovkkaid oktii ja oanit jos vejolaš","subTasks":[{"label":"a","task":"$\\frac{3}{7} + \\frac{2}{7}$","solution":"$\\frac{3}{7} + \\frac{2}{7} = \\frac{5}{7}$","expressionAnswer":"5/7"},{"label":"b","task":"$\\frac{7}{3} + \\frac{8}{3}$","solution":"$\\frac{7}{3} + \\frac{8}{3} = 5$","answer":5},{"label":"c","task":"$\\frac{9}{6} - \\frac{1}{6}$","solution":"$\\frac{9}{6} - \\frac{1}{6} = \\frac{4}{3}$","expressionAnswer":"4/3"},{"label":"d","task":"$\\frac{7}{4} - \\frac{3}{4}$","solution":"$\\frac{7}{4} - \\frac{3}{4} = 1$","answer":1},{"label":"e","task":"$\\frac{16}{5} + \\frac{2}{5} + \\frac{7}{5}$","solution":"$\\frac{16}{5} + \\frac{2}{5} + \\frac{7}{5} = 5$","answer":5},{"label":"f","task":"$\\frac{19}{23} - \\frac{18}{23} + \\frac{4}{23}$","solution":"$\\frac{19}{23} - \\frac{18}{23} + \\frac{4}{23} = \\frac{5}{23}$","expressionAnswer":"5/23"}],"hints":["Go namuheaddjit leat seammaláganat, de mii dušše lasihit dahje eretváldit čájeheaddjiid"],"solution":"a) $\\frac{5}{7}$, b) $5$, c) $\\frac{4}{3}$, d) $1$, e) $5$, f) $\\frac{5}{23}$","solutionVideo":"eISYgBtzgm0","allowsUpload":true,"allowsCanvasDrawing":true}},{"id":"1t-1-4-text-utvide","type":"text","content":"**Cuovkkaid viiddideapmi (no: å utvide brøker)**\n\nMuhtumin mii háliidit viiddidit cuovkkaid. Vai viiddidit cuovkka, de fertet geardut seamma loguin cuovkasárgá badjelis ja vuolde. Dáinna lágiin mii sáhttit oažžut ođđa namuheaddji nuppástuhtekeahttá cuovkka duohta árvvu."},{"id":"1t-1-4-warning-utvide","type":"warning","content":"**Fuom.:** Lea dehálaš muitit ahte fertet geardut SIHKE badjelis ja vuolde oktanaga. Jos dušše geardut badjelis dahje dušše vuolde, de nuppástuhttá cuovkka árvvu ja oaččut boasttu vástádusa."},{"id":"1t-1-4-example-8","type":"example","title":"Ovdamearka 8","problem":"Viiddit cuovkkaid:\n\na) Viiddit cuovkka $\\frac{5}{3}$ nu ahte namuheaddji šaddá 6\n\nb) Viiddit cuovkka $\\frac{2}{5}$ nu ahte namuheaddji šaddá $10x$","solution":"**Čoavddus:**\n\na) $\\frac{5}{3} = \\frac{5 \\cdot 2}{3 \\cdot 2} = \\frac{10}{6}$\n\nb) $\\frac{2}{5} = \\frac{2 \\cdot 2x}{5 \\cdot 2x} = \\frac{4x}{10x}$","solutionVideo":"Va5tudGkywI"},{"id":"1t-1-4-ex-block-7","type":"exercise","exercise":{"id":"1t-1-4-ex-7","number":"7","type":"classic","difficulty":"lett","task":"Viiddit cuovkka","subTasks":[{"label":"a","task":"$\\frac{7}{9}$ nu ahte namuheaddji šaddá 18","solution":"$\\frac{7}{9} = \\frac{14}{18}$","expressionAnswer":"14/18"},{"label":"b","task":"$\\frac{3}{2}$ nu ahte namuheaddji šaddá $2x$","solution":"$\\frac{3}{2} = \\frac{3x}{2x}$","expressionAnswer":"3x/(2x)"},{"label":"c","task":"$\\frac{8}{3}$ nu ahte namuheaddji šaddá $15x$","solution":"$\\frac{8}{3} = \\frac{40x}{15x}$","expressionAnswer":"40x/(15x)"}],"hints":["Gávnna mainna fertet geardut namuheaddji vai oaččut ođđa namuheaddji, ja geardde čájeheaddji seammáin"],"solution":"a) $\\frac{14}{18}$, b) $\\frac{3x}{2x}$, c) $\\frac{40x}{15x}$","solutionVideo":"7Mcn7TwkF4Q","allowsUpload":true,"allowsCanvasDrawing":true}},{"id":"1t-1-4-text-uliknevner","type":"text","content":"**Cuovkkat sierralágan namuheaddjiin**\n\nGo mii deaivvadit cuovkkaiguin main lea sierralágan namuheaddji, de fertet viiddidit ovtta dahje goappašat cuovkkaid vai oažžut oktasaš namuheaddji. De geahččat vuos jos gávdno lohku mainna mii dušše dárbbašit geardut ovtta namuheaddjiin vai oažžut nuppi namuheaddji."},{"id":"1t-1-4-example-9","type":"example","title":"Ovdamearka 9","problem":"Geasa cuovkkaid oktii:\n\n$$\\frac{1}{2} + \\frac{2}{10}$$","solution":"**Čoavddus:**\n\n$$\\frac{1}{2} + \\frac{2}{10} = \\frac{1 \\cdot 5}{2 \\cdot 5} + \\frac{2}{10} = \\frac{5}{10} + \\frac{2}{10} = \\frac{5 + 2}{10} = \\frac{7}{10}$$","solutionVideo":"wP4OsHmRsHw"},{"id":"1t-1-4-example-10","type":"example","title":"Ovdamearka 10","problem":"Geasa oktii:\n\n$$2 + \\frac{3}{7}$$","solution":"**Čoavddus:**\n\n$$2 + \\frac{3}{7} = \\frac{2}{1} + \\frac{3}{7} = \\frac{2 \\cdot 7}{1 \\cdot 7} + \\frac{3}{7} = \\frac{14}{7} + \\frac{3}{7} = \\frac{17}{7}$$\n\nMuitte: $n = \\frac{n}{1}$","solutionVideo":"6HJA-qNweVw"},{"id":"1t-1-4-ex-block-8","type":"exercise","exercise":{"id":"1t-1-4-ex-8","number":"8","type":"classic","difficulty":"medium","task":"Geasa cuovkkaid oktii ja oanit jos vejolaš","subTasks":[{"label":"a","task":"$\\frac{4}{6} + \\frac{1}{3}$","solution":"$\\frac{4}{6} + \\frac{1}{3} = 1$","answer":1},{"label":"b","task":"$\\frac{4}{7} - \\frac{1}{14}$","solution":"$\\frac{4}{7} - \\frac{1}{14} = \\frac{1}{2}$","expressionAnswer":"1/2"},{"label":"c","task":"$\\frac{12}{8} + \\frac{1}{4}$","solution":"$\\frac{12}{8} + \\frac{1}{4} = \\frac{7}{4}$","expressionAnswer":"7/4"},{"label":"d","task":"$1 + \\frac{1}{5}$","solution":"$1 + \\frac{1}{5} = \\frac{6}{5}$","expressionAnswer":"6/5"},{"label":"e","task":"$\\frac{4}{2} - \\frac{1}{6} + 1$","solution":"$\\frac{4}{2} - \\frac{1}{6} + 1 = \\frac{17}{6}$","expressionAnswer":"17/6"},{"label":"f","task":"$\\frac{7}{12} + \\frac{1}{6} + 2$","solution":"$\\frac{7}{12} + \\frac{1}{6} + 2 = \\frac{11}{4}$","expressionAnswer":"11/4"}],"hints":["Gávnna oktasaš namuheaddji ovdal go lasihat oktii"],"solution":"a) $1$, b) $\\frac{1}{2}$, c) $\\frac{7}{4}$, d) $\\frac{6}{5}$, e) $\\frac{17}{6}$, f) $\\frac{11}{4}$","solutionVideo":"Zw67qGw10oc","allowsUpload":true,"allowsCanvasDrawing":true}},{"id":"1t-1-4-text-gangenevner","type":"text","content":"**Namuheaddjiid geardun oktii vai gávdnat oktasaš namuheaddji**\n\nGo ii leat vejolaš dušše geardut ovtta namuheaddji, de fertet geardut goappašiid. Vuohki mii álo doaibmá go galgat gávdnat oktasaš namuheaddji guovtti cuvkii lea viiddidit vuosttaš cuovkka nuppi cuovkka namuheaddjiin, ja nuppi cuovkka vuosttaš cuovkka namuheaddjiin."},{"id":"1t-1-4-example-11","type":"example","title":"Ovdamearka 11","problem":"Geasa cuovkkaid oktii:\n\n$$\\frac{1}{2} + \\frac{3}{7}$$","solution":"**Čoavddus:**\n\n$$\\frac{1}{2} + \\frac{3}{7} = \\frac{1 \\cdot 7}{2 \\cdot 7} + \\frac{3 \\cdot 2}{7 \\cdot 2} = \\frac{7}{14} + \\frac{6}{14} = \\frac{13}{14}$$","solutionVideo":"1WmmzOBu82M"},{"id":"1t-1-4-ex-block-9","type":"exercise","exercise":{"id":"1t-1-4-ex-9","number":"9","type":"classic","difficulty":"medium","task":"Geasa cuovkkaid oktii ja oanit jos vejolaš","subTasks":[{"label":"a","task":"$\\frac{1}{2} + \\frac{1}{3}$","solution":"$\\frac{1}{2} + \\frac{1}{3} = \\frac{5}{6}$","expressionAnswer":"5/6"},{"label":"b","task":"$\\frac{4}{3} + \\frac{2}{7}$","solution":"$\\frac{4}{3} + \\frac{2}{7} = \\frac{34}{21}$","expressionAnswer":"34/21"},{"label":"c","task":"$\\frac{2}{5} - \\frac{1}{4}$","solution":"$\\frac{2}{5} - \\frac{1}{4} = \\frac{3}{20}$","expressionAnswer":"3/20"},{"label":"d","task":"$\\frac{3}{9} + \\frac{1}{5}$","solution":"$\\frac{3}{9} + \\frac{1}{5} = \\frac{8}{15}$","expressionAnswer":"8/15"},{"label":"e","task":"$\\frac{1}{2} - 3 + \\frac{1}{5}$","solution":"$\\frac{1}{2} - 3 + \\frac{1}{5} = -\\frac{23}{10}$","expressionAnswer":"-23/10"},{"label":"f","task":"$\\frac{7}{2} - \\frac{1}{11} - 2$","solution":"$\\frac{7}{2} - \\frac{1}{11} - 2 = \\frac{31}{22}$","expressionAnswer":"31/22"}],"hints":["Viiddit goappašat cuovkkaid vai oaččut oktasaš namuheaddji"],"solution":"a) $\\frac{5}{6}$, b) $\\frac{34}{21}$, c) $\\frac{3}{20}$, d) $\\frac{8}{15}$, e) $-\\frac{23}{10}$, f) $\\frac{31}{22}$","solutionVideo":"9P-uyNKGiFo","allowsUpload":true,"allowsCanvasDrawing":true}},{"id":"1t-1-4-text-mfn","type":"text","content":"**Uhcimus oktasaš namuheaddji (no: minste felles nevner) gávdnan**\n\nGo mii geavahit vuogi mii lea bajábealde, de sáhttá dáhpáhuvvat ahte mii oažžut dárbbašmeahttumit alla oktasaš namuheaddji. Jos mii ovdamearkka dihte galgat lasihit oktii: $\\frac{1}{21} + \\frac{1}{14}$ de oažžut $21 \\cdot 14 = 294$ namuheaddjin.\n\nDát dáhpáhuvvá danin go mis leat oktasaš fáktorat namuheaddjiin. Mii oaidnit ahte sáhttit buvttadit cealkámuša ná: $\\frac{1}{3 \\cdot 7} + \\frac{1}{2 \\cdot 7}$. Goappašat namuheaddjit sisttisdollet nappo fáktora 7, nu ahte dat lea oktasaš. Vuosttaš namuheaddjis lea 3 mii nuppi namuheaddjis ii leat, ja nuppi namuheaddjis lea 2 mii vuosttažis ii leat. De sáhttit lasihit dan mii váilu juohke cuvkii vai oažžut oktasaš namuheaddji:\n\n$$\\frac{1}{3 \\cdot 7} + \\frac{1}{2 \\cdot 7} = \\frac{2 \\cdot 1}{2 \\cdot 3 \\cdot 7} + \\frac{3 \\cdot 1}{3 \\cdot 2 \\cdot 7} = \\frac{2}{42} + \\frac{3}{42} = \\frac{5}{42}$$"},{"id":"1t-1-4-example-12","type":"example","title":"Ovdamearka 12","problem":"Geasa cuovkkaid oktii:\n\n$$\\frac{1}{10} + \\frac{1}{15}$$","solution":"**Čoavddus:**\n\n$$\\frac{1}{10} + \\frac{1}{15} = \\frac{1}{{\\color{blue}5} \\cdot 2} + \\frac{1}{{\\color{blue}5} \\cdot 3} = \\frac{1 \\cdot {\\color{green}3}}{{\\color{blue}5} \\cdot 2 \\cdot {\\color{green}3}} + \\frac{1 \\cdot {\\color{green}2}}{{\\color{blue}5} \\cdot 3 \\cdot {\\color{green}2}} = \\frac{3}{30} + \\frac{2}{30} = \\frac{{\\color{red}5}}{30} = \\frac{1}{6}$$","solutionVideo":"p027J0GO8VQ"},{"id":"1t-1-4-ex-block-10","type":"exercise","exercise":{"id":"1t-1-4-ex-10","number":"10","type":"classic","difficulty":"vanskelig","task":"Geavat uhcimus oktasaš namuheaddji vai geasat cuovkkaid oktii ja oanit jos vejolaš","subTasks":[{"label":"a","task":"$\\frac{1}{6} + \\frac{1}{8}$","solution":"$\\frac{1}{6} + \\frac{1}{8} = \\frac{7}{24}$","expressionAnswer":"7/24"},{"label":"b","task":"$\\frac{4}{14} + \\frac{2}{10}$","solution":"$\\frac{4}{14} + \\frac{2}{10} = \\frac{17}{35}$","expressionAnswer":"17/35"},{"label":"c","task":"$\\frac{3}{14} - \\frac{1}{21}$","solution":"$\\frac{3}{14} - \\frac{1}{21} = \\frac{1}{6}$","expressionAnswer":"1/6"},{"label":"d","task":"$\\frac{1}{9} + \\frac{1}{12}$","solution":"$\\frac{1}{9} + \\frac{1}{12} = \\frac{7}{36}$","expressionAnswer":"7/36"},{"label":"e","task":"$\\frac{1}{20} + \\frac{1}{25}$","solution":"$\\frac{1}{20} + \\frac{1}{25} = \\frac{9}{100}$","expressionAnswer":"9/100"},{"label":"f","task":"$\\frac{7}{22} - \\frac{1}{33} - 1$","solution":"$\\frac{7}{22} - \\frac{1}{33} - 1 = -\\frac{47}{66}$","expressionAnswer":"-47/66"}],"hints":["Buvtte namuheaddjiid vai gávnnat oktasaš fáktoriid"],"solution":"a) $\\frac{7}{24}$, b) $\\frac{17}{35}$, c) $\\frac{1}{6}$, d) $\\frac{7}{36}$, e) $\\frac{9}{100}$, f) $-\\frac{47}{66}$","solutionVideo":"QX3Jz7NPFrA","allowsUpload":true,"allowsCanvasDrawing":true}},{"id":"1t-1-4-repetisjon","type":"collapsible","title":"Geardduhanbihtát","buttonText":"Čájet geardduhanbihtáid","content":[{"id":"1t-1-4-rep-1","type":"exercise","exercise":{"id":"1t-1-4-rep-ex-1","number":"R1","type":"classic","difficulty":"lett","task":"Geardde cuovkkaid oktii","subTasks":[{"label":"a","task":"$\\frac{2}{5} \\cdot \\frac{3}{7}$","expressionAnswer":"6/35"},{"label":"b","task":"$\\frac{11}{2} \\cdot \\frac{5}{6}$","expressionAnswer":"55/12"},{"label":"c","task":"$3 \\cdot \\frac{1}{8}$","expressionAnswer":"3/8"},{"label":"d","task":"$\\frac{3}{2} \\cdot \\frac{1}{4} \\cdot \\frac{9}{8}$","expressionAnswer":"27/64"},{"label":"e","task":"$\\frac{2}{13} \\cdot 9$","expressionAnswer":"18/13"},{"label":"f","task":"$9 \\cdot \\frac{10}{7} \\cdot \\frac{10}{7}$","expressionAnswer":"900/49"}],"solution":"a) $\\frac{6}{35}$, b) $\\frac{55}{12}$, c) $\\frac{3}{8}$, d) $\\frac{27}{64}$, e) $\\frac{18}{13}$, f) $\\frac{900}{49}$","hideInlineSolution":true,"hints":["Geardde čájeheaddji čájeheaddjiin ja namuheaddji namuheaddjiin"],"allowsUploa